[{"answer":"Right, Sandra.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/1.mp3"},{"answer":"You wanted to see me to get some feedback on your group's proposal.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/2.mp3"},{"answer":"The one you're submitting for the Geography Society field trip competition.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I've had a look through your proposal and I think it's a really good choice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/4.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, I only have a few things to say about it, but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/5.mp3"},{"answer":"even in an outline document like this,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/6.mp3"},{"answer":"you really have to be careful to avoid typos and problems with layout in the proposal,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/7.mp3"},{"answer":"and even in the contents page.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/8.mp3"},{"answer":"So read it through carefully before submitting it, okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Will do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/10.mp3"},{"answer":"And, I've made a few notes on the proposal about things which could have been better sequenced.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/12.mp3"},{"answer":"As for the writing itself,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I've annotated the proposal as and where I thought it could be improved.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Generally speaking, I feel you've often used complex structures and long sentences for the sake of it","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/15.mp3"},{"answer":"and as a consequence....","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/16.mp3"},{"answer":"although your paragraphing and inclusion of sub-headings help...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/17.mp3"},{"answer":"it's quite hard to follow your train of thought at times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/18.mp3"},{"answer":"So cut them down a bit, can you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. And don't forget simple formatting like numbering.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Didn't I use page numbers?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't mean that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Look, you've remembered to include headers and footers, which is good,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/24.mp3"},{"answer":"but listing ideas clearly is important.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Number them or use bullet points, which is even clearer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you'll focus the reader on your main points.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought your suggestion to go to the Navajo Tribal Park was a very good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I've always wanted to go there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/29.mp3"},{"answer":"My father was a great fan of cowboy films and the Wild West","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/30.mp3"},{"answer":"so I was subjected to seeing all the epics,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/31.mp3"},{"answer":"many of which were shot there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/32.mp3"},{"answer":"As a consequence, it feels very familiar to me","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/33.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's awesome both geographically and visually,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/34.mp3"},{"answer":"so it's somewhere I've always wanted to visit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/35.mp3"},{"answer":"The subsequent research I did","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/36.mp3"},{"answer":"and the online photographs made me even keener.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, let's look at the content of your proposal now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you find it comprehensive enough?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, yes and no.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/41.mp3"},{"answer":"You've listed several different topics on your contents page,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/42.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'm not sure they're all relevant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/43.mp3"},{"answer":"No?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I thought that from the perspective of a field trip,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/45.mp3"},{"answer":"one thing I needed to focus on was the sandstone plateau and cliffs themselves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/46.mp3"},{"answer":"The way they tower up from the flat landscape is just amazing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/47.mp3"},{"answer":"The fact that the surrounding softer rocks were eroded by wind and rain,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/48.mp3"},{"answer":"leaving these huge outcrops high above the plain.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/49.mp3"},{"answer":"It's hardly surprising that tourists flock to see the area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd agree with including those points...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And then the fact that it's been home to native American Navajos","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/53.mp3"},{"answer":"and all the social history that goes with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/54.mp3"},{"answer":"The hardships they endured trying to save their territory from the invading settlers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Their culture is so rich - all those wonderful stories.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I agree it's interesting, but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/57.mp3"},{"answer":"it's not immediately relevant to your proposal, Sandra, so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/58.mp3"},{"answer":"at this stage, I suggest you focus on other considerations.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I think an indication of what the students on the trip could actually do when they get there","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/60.mp3"},{"answer":"should be far more central,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/61.mp3"},{"answer":"so that certainly needs to be included and to be expanded upon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/62.mp3"},{"answer":"And I'd like to see something about the local wildlife, and vegetation too,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/63.mp3"},{"answer":"not that I imagine there's much to see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Presumably the tourist invasion hasn't helped.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, I'll do some work on those two areas as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/66.mp3"},{"answer":"But you're right, there's not much apart from some very shallow-rooted species.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Although it's cold and snowy there in the winter,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/68.mp3"},{"answer":"the earth is baked so hard in the summer sun that rainwater can't penetrate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/69.mp3"},{"answer":"So it's a case of flood or drought, really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/70.mp3"},{"answer":"So, I understand.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, before we look at everything in more detail,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/72.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got a few factual questions for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/73.mp3"},{"answer":"It would be a good idea to include the answers in your finished proposal,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/74.mp3"},{"answer":"because they're missing from your draft.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/76.mp3"},{"answer":"So, you mentioned the monoliths and the spires, which was good,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/77.mp3"},{"answer":"but what area does the tribal park cover?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/79.mp3"},{"answer":"12,000 hectares,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/80.mp3"},{"answer":"and the plain is at about 5,850 metres above sea level.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Larger than I expected.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Where's the nearest accommodation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/84.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a practical detail that you haven't included.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you done any research on that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/87.mp3"},{"answer":"There's nowhere to stay in the park itself,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/88.mp3"},{"answer":"but there's an old trading post called Goulding quite near.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/89.mp3"},{"answer":"All kinds of tours start from Goulding, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/90.mp3"},{"answer":"What kind of tours?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/91.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the most popular are in four-wheel drive jeeps -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/92.mp3"},{"answer":"but I wouldn't recommend hiring those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/93.mp3"},{"answer":"I think the best way to appreciate the area would be to hire horses instead","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/94.mp3"},{"answer":"and trek around on those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/95.mp3"},{"answer":"Biking is not allowed","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/96.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's impossible to drive around the area in private vehicles.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/97.mp3"},{"answer":"The tracks are too rough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/98.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, lastly. What else is worth visiting there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/99.mp3"},{"answer":"There are several caves,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/100.mp3"},{"answer":"but I haven't looked into any details.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/101.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll find out about them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/102.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/103.mp3"},{"answer":"Now what I'd like to know is...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-1-part-3-2023-07-24-23-13-52/104.mp3"}]
